{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日発売だった\n『UPDATE girls vol.2』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイーツについて熱く語ってきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知る人ぞ知る\nというか中田ブログをしっかり読んでる人しか知らない\n中田のスイーツ好きを\nここで解禁してしまいました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/6713938/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、雑誌はグラビアとかが多かったけど\n何かについて熱く語る中田は久々な気がする！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紹介してるスイーツ\nみなさんも良かったら食べてみてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/6713938/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃ可愛いみなみが表紙なのが\n目印です＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも\n真夏、かりん、さゆにゃん、みさみさ、きいちゃん、蘭世、ななみん、未央奈、若月\nが載ってます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ROUND UP!! @JAM EXPO 2015』の紙書籍版\n今日発売です！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先月には電子書籍版が出てたから\nもう読んだ方はいると思うけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紙書籍版しか！な方々、お待たせしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/6713938/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだの方は\nアイドル座談会を是非読んでください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/28/6713938/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日、生ドルに出てくださった\n東京パフォーマンスドールさんや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以前に生ドルに出てくださった\nSUPER☆GiRLSさん、lyrical schoolさん、夢みるアドレセンスさん